+### Git LFS
+
+The SQLite database is tracked by Git LFS. If the file is only about 134 bytes and contains a pointer like `version https://git-lfs.github.com/spec/v1`, you have the LFS pointer, not the real database.
+
+```bash
+git lfs install
+git lfs pull
+```
